nwhile, Puniru plans a big surprise for Halloween.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-08-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1OT0ekDRVUjmVufDlMkz1bpy0fd.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1OT0ekDRVUjmVufDlMkz1bpy0fd.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/241811/season/1/episode/20"},{"id":"6380213","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Episodio 21","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Hodai hatches a scheme to discredit Kotaro in Alice's eyes by having him face Nanpa in an artistic face-off.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-08-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4s5zW52XliF6jb6jjhrOyJ2G05w.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4s5zW52XliF6jb6jjhrOyJ2G05w.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/241811/season/1/episode/21"},{"id":"6380214","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Episodio 22","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kotaro gets into a big fight with Puniru, who runs away to Mami's apartment and meets the Kirara family.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-09-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tXhO8baUwX4S3oXzyS91LhlLzOF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tXhO8baUwX4S3oXzyS91LhlLzOF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/241811/season/1/episode/22"},{"id":"6380215","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Episodio 23","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kotaro holds a study group with friends, but his careless remark to Gelee ends up having dire consequences.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-09-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/989irLfFn9N2